# File naming conventions (minimal)

## Naming

- Use lowercase, hyphenated file and directory names.
- Use `PascalCase` for exported React component function names.

## Extensions

- Use `.jsx` for files containing JSX.
- Use `.js` for non-JSX modules.
- Add `.server` before extension for server-only modules (`*.server.js`, `*.server.jsx`).

## Common patterns

- Custom hooks in `app/hooks` should use `use-*.jsx` naming.
- Layout route modules use `_layout.jsx`.
- Use `index.jsx`/`index.js` only for directory entry modules.

## Imports

- Inside `app/`, import with the `#/*` alias.
- Inside `app/themes/<slug>/` and `app/plugins/<slug>/`, use relative imports for sibling theme/plugin modules; keep `#/…` for core app modules.
- Do not include file extensions in imports (except `.json` when required).
